1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
What if he falls apart emotionally?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,040
He already has.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,080
What if no one can help him?

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,930
He wants to do nothing. He’s stuck.

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,260
I’m no counselor, but I should help.

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,800
As a friend. You know what I mean?

7
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:16,120
Some things neither of us can fix.

8
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,480
Then the film is off? No more shooting?

9
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,180
Of course we keep shooting.

10
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,100
Right. Don’t rush.

11
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,000
Go back first.

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:29,170
Think it over. Talk to one person first.

13
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,650
I’ll go and talk to him.

14
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,160
Talk to him. Say: I’ll help you write it.

15
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,400
Get that script written.

16
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:38,650
That alone would mean a lot.

17
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,620
Is the screenplay the hard part?

18
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:45,820
Not the screenplay. Helping him.

19
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:48,300
Just get it made?

20
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,240
It’s about more than making it.

21
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,500
It’s whether you can listen to him.

22
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,650
And give him support.

23
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
So he can trust you and rely on you.

24
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:06,100
Get this step right. The next ones follow.

25
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:10,820
If you can’t do this, how will you work with anyone else?

26
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:13,920
Can you take this first step?

27
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:14,920
No problem.

28
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:17,670
We’re not at steps two or three yet.

29
00:01:17,714 --> 00:01:20,600
Then talk to him first.

30
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,560
Any time. Even right now.

31
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,420
Then talk to him.

32
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:25,000
We could call him first.

33
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:25,980
All right.

34
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:28,040
You’re all here. Let’s call together.

35
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,900
Let’s call and talk to him.

36
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,650
Let’s talk.

37
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:37,420
Hello.

38
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:39,780
Hey, hello.

39
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:41,500
How are you doing?

40
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,800
I’m at 510.

41
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:49,720
We’re talking about the film you wanted to make.

42
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:50,700
Right.

43
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:54,000
You haven’t been well lately. How are you?
